Related family (not asserted to be this file)
---------------------------------------------
A shareware ITF barcode set from Chaos Microsystems Inc. (Daniel Lajeunesse,
Gloucester, Ontario, 1999; Fontlab V2.5) is documented at:

  https://luc.devroye.org/fonts-29893.html
  https://luc.devroye.org/barcode.html

Listings of that family use the name-table copyright
"Copyright 1999 by Chaos Microsystems Inc., All rights reserved." and are
labeled "personal use · check for commercial" on download sites. That is not
a redistributable MIT grant, and this NOTICE does not adopt those terms.

This repo's TTF is the same *kind* of font (ITF / interleaved 2 of 5) but is
**not confirmed to be the Chaos file**: different family name ("Code 2/5
Interleaved" vs "Interleaved 2of5"), copyright year (2000 vs 1999), version
string ("1.00; June 21, 2000" vs "Fontlab V2.5 9/17/99"), and size
(~12 KB vs ~62 KB).

